  speakers: 070000000700000000000000070000000700000000000000
  dialogue:
  - Hi there I'm Shelley, founder of Shellow, a shell estate platform connecting
    hermit crab buyers and renters to their new home.
  - We have a limited supply of free pens but times are tough so we're limiting who
    gets those.
  - Hi Shelley, I'm Finnley! Founder of LinkedFin, a professional networking app.
  - If you're looking to work at Shellow unfortunately we're having a bit of a housing
    crisis at the moment.
  - No one is selling and we have a ton of buyers. If you were a shell sourcer, I
    would hire you on the spot.
  - I'm not a shell sourcer but if you download my app, I'd be happy to connect you
    with one!
